{"term": "انحراف جنسي", "lang": "ar", "script": "arab", "romanization": "inḥirāf jinsī", "category": "religious_moral_status", "subcategory": "sexual_deviance", "concept": "paraphilia", "is_novel_concept": false, "register": "moral_religious", "crude": 60, "technical": 40, "recognition_pct_current": 92, "recognition_pct_peak": 92, "peak_year": null, "regional": null, "definition": "Sexual deviance or perversion; any behavior or orientation judged to deviate from religiously and socially sanctioned norms, deployed to condemn homosexuality, premarital sex, BDSM, and other non-normative sexuality.", "english_term": "sexual deviance / perversion", "english_translation_quality": "approximate", "notes": "Literally 'sexual deviation'; commonly deployed in MSA media, religious fatwas, and legal discourse as a condemnation term; mapped to paraphilia as the nearest clinical concept but انحراف جنسي is inherently pejorative and morally loaded, unlike the neutral DSM term."}
{"term": "شذوذ جنسي", "lang": "ar", "script": "arab", "romanization": "shudhūdh jinsī", "category": "religious_moral_status", "subcategory": "homosexuality_condemnation", "concept": "sodomite", "is_novel_concept": false, "register": "moral_religious", "crude": 70, "technical": 30, "recognition_pct_current": 96, "recognition_pct_peak": 96, "peak_year": null, "regional": null, "definition": "Sexual deviance or abnormality; the dominant MSA legal and religious term for homosexuality, carrying inherent condemnation and used to criminalize LGBTQ identity across Arab jurisdictions.", "english_term": "sodomy / sexual deviance", "english_translation_quality": "approximate", "notes": "Literally 'sexual abnormality' (شذوذ = deviation/aberration); the primary official Arabic term used against LGBTQ people in legislation, media, and religious discourse; criminalized under شذوذ جنسي statutes in many Arab countries; broader than 'sodomite' since it encompasses all non-normative sexuality, not only anal sex; mapped to sodomite as the closest registry concept combining legal/religious condemnation."}
